version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
abstract: >-
  A Gross-Pitaevskii fluid solver for 16 cognitive modes with a real
  split-step Fourier kinetic step, a hardware-verified quantum bridge
  (2 qubits, 3 separate measurements), and the measurement protocol that
  compares them. Every claim in the README is backed by a measured
  number; the section "Limits" states explicitly what the system does
  not prove.
keywords:
  - gross-pitaevskii equation
  - split-step fourier method
  - quantum-classical hybrid loop
  - superconducting qubits
  - measurement methodology
